            <div xml:id="m-bbdd89d9-852b-46eb-8fd8-46320d0c211d">
              <lg xml:id="m-6d915741-050d-47d9-a8da-0319ef41e44b">
                <l xml:id="m-1b34ce65-6533-456b-bd18-0c96dfb17a48" facs="#m-1f5f8373-b230-4a6d-9241-98c565f61d9f" label="text-like">Common of One Martyr. P. T. Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-6ce68ef0-f6bb-47b2-ab0e-a67e3998c2a9" facs="#m-22bcad40-e5fa-4dce-91c3-6ac5dc812cd6" label="ambiguous">1148</l><l xml:id="m-9441447d-924a-4b36-ba62-e68f48231b46" facs="#m-158140ae-437f-4762-8eb5-69b07ef69351" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-4d7211a0-3933-4740-87fb-779a7e0a5afe" facs="#m-2a1ab97c-1513-40d2-834c-b24630995383" label="ambiguous">H Le</l><l xml:id="m-d7be15ea-ec2f-4f8f-93ca-9138f32116b5" facs="#m-f5079b6c-5808-4522-b343-839a8ad4731f" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-e9e771b4-7306-4601-9e97-68636fb760ef" facs="#m-9de9f749-80b2-4805-8076-4e51e777486c" label="lyrics-like">isti, Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-347574a1-6d2f-411a-a375-465352898112" facs="#m-4997666b-e254-419d-b000-b753afd91149" label="ambiguous">V. Po-su¬</l><l xml:id="m-0edd947f-4a32-4aea-8b92-4d07690f817e" facs="#m-c707e1cc-916f-413d-ad0b-f8d7b8df2740" label="ambiguous">mi¬ ne,</l><l xml:id="m-563f76da-8052-4756-80da-a4a25e1c0afd" facs="#m-0eebd5c1-7782-4ffb-a085-2688501ffc54" label="lyrics-like">super cáput é¬</l><l xml:id="m-01155427-851c-4586-8e9d-af883210373a" facs="#m-086db52d-1970-45c2-b872-c9f052963978" label="ambiguous">jus</l><l xml:id="m-e9f2c2e3-c843-4c52-9942-bff6fde87b47" facs="#m-3f703254-8cd9-4f8c-8fd3-40e3b5827398" label="ambiguous">co¬</l><l xml:id="m-27ab5614-0c99-4bfd-9fbf-f995d44ab383" facs="#m-7c7f0f5a-fa0d-452a-a570-2f6fa5c0e2cb" label="ambiguous">pide “pre-ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-3bcec80d-2df8-4316-bc43-41f8c46b2858" facs="#m-35f81801-6021-4800-acb4-44a44d8da6c7" label="lyrics-like">ró¬</l><l xml:id="m-d19e3630-ea07-4c45-97d2-1d6cf4af458b" facs="#m-19d3ebc4-1331-4bd6-9b71-b9f82fde570b" label="lyrics-like">nam de lá¬</l><l xml:id="m-bdcf93e9-a032-4ac8-9c39-31ecdcdef033" facs="#m-5d051c57-4d46-4af1-91aa-4a0e3d27afb8" label="lyrics-like">óso.</l><l xml:id="m-ec2939a0-5f13-4f01-a59f-9b13815b4eab" facs="#m-18c4bddf-8c13-4dbf-8c8d-cc9daadd93ac" label="ambiguous">*Sequentia sancti Evangelli secundum Joannem. Joann. 15.</l><l xml:id="m-d4d63788-a5e0-4786-87ed-7420e4b77b4d" facs="#m-f906bb98-b3c7-4a7c-9045-01c55f09c47e" label="lyrics-like">IN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus disci-(nisi in me manséritis. Ego sum vitis,</l><l xml:id="m-7219c64e-fcb4-4dd1-b01f-9580df2d5810" facs="#m-00a5be4e-1e87-459f-9ad6-2efc0531e654" label="ambiguous">L pulis suis: Ego sum vitis vera:</l><l xml:id="m-1ad7b529-f13e-400a-ab7a-95a908c6c999" facs="#m-1225ba27-d0ef-4bdc-aa8b-22d5d9221a22" label="lyrics-like">vos pálmites: qui manet in me, et</l><l xml:id="m-0e6e20c0-fafa-46b2-a001-c5cc2e7cf89b" facs="#m-3afc1f74-f9f9-492f-af5b-17c753fcff16" label="ambiguous">et Pater meus agricola est. Omnem</l><l xml:id="m-0f7bccfe-cb34-4bb6-ada9-d2a388871304" facs="#m-4284b0dc-9ea7-4723-a962-82d08b07e0f2" label="ambiguous">ego in eo, hic fert fructum multum:</l><l xml:id="m-4b12e355-55e4-47af-a08a-1aab5e0bf421" facs="#m-148ac766-5f8f-4b9a-98db-4f5826b0f09e" label="lyrics-like">pálmitem in me non feréntem fru¬</l><l xml:id="m-84768f44-43b3-4b83-bdfc-4be961daa333" facs="#m-a8df8edb-5a20-4f3e-8e95-014405a19344" label="lyrics-like">quia sine me nihil potéstis fácere.</l><l xml:id="m-e593cd6f-9428-4baa-9c0f-372ec6d893cb" facs="#m-887ecae3-9f74-4858-ba7f-9b02bba74e7c" label="ambiguous">ctum, tollet eum: et omnem, qui</l><l xml:id="m-a5a5594f-e041-42f9-a6de-0e0d2e313772" facs="#m-37530a75-7b9f-4357-b98f-5998092a3844" label="lyrics-like">Si quis in me non mánserit, mitté¬</l><l xml:id="m-7fa43a62-4e53-450b-9f7d-b933ec070dae" facs="#m-5f8510be-c997-4318-91a1-fb62ec2a1ab1" label="lyrics-like">fert fructum, purgábit eum, ut fru¬</l><l xml:id="m-3b253e4b-1a74-48ba-a332-c5d78a767531" facs="#m-6b7cf759-d554-4412-b479-5ba52648682a" label="lyrics-like">tur foras sicut palmes, et aréscet, et</l><l xml:id="m-c950a4d8-6566-4625-977a-dd35537a191d" facs="#m-edcb2e31-754c-46ae-9a2e-22bbf5601ea8" label="lyrics-like">ctum plus áfferat. Jam vos mundi</l><l xml:id="m-3e13f50f-b652-43b6-b05e-4e78d1222138" facs="#m-952df740-92b6-4a28-9b99-306c07a8080c" label="lyrics-like">cólligent eum, et in ignem mittent,</l><l xml:id="m-91d81b13-af70-4322-85fc-4cf85f2eb3de" facs="#m-d6331907-ba07-4ee6-a258-925ba9ec216c" label="lyrics-like">estis propter sermónem, quem locú¬</l><l xml:id="m-0f693102-46c2-40a4-95b1-707090eb127b" facs="#m-dde8a0a5-9229-4e25-9911-d3cfa61047c6" label="lyrics-like">et ardet. Si manséritis in me, et</l><l xml:id="m-61a4e827-6f75-44dc-9fb9-ec857eb3c21e" facs="#m-f2fffebc-e6ba-49a1-9a85-667e7ea45646" label="lyrics-like">tus sum vobis. Manéte in me, et</l><l xml:id="m-578fcad5-de65-43f8-a48b-1fb09420ef55" facs="#m-be58a411-8982-45f9-9e42-3d2d25a9f1db" label="lyrics-like">verba mea in vobis mánserint:</l><l xml:id="m-509c06e0-faad-44df-aac5-666f3c791629" facs="#m-76215910-b087-4b0f-b888-eb8703159ddc" label="ambiguous">ego in vobis. Sicut palmes non</l><l xml:id="m-75d8c282-2b6d-460d-9149-20268d29f747" facs="#m-ed6ba30d-638e-4775-866a-65f99cc7a3eb" label="lyrics-like">quodcúmque voluéritis, petétis, et</l><l xml:id="m-b979c405-2ed4-43df-bd5c-13c1ab7d2af3" facs="#m-298ad0db-e31d-4139-8345-d6aba7895aae" label="lyrics-like">potest ferre fructum à semetípso,</l><l xml:id="m-eb9107cf-93ca-402f-8c8c-a1c021d01579" facs="#m-52465a04-e945-4dff-b52c-1b2a1f2d6bf9" label="ambiguous">fiet vobis.</l><l xml:id="m-3e586e36-9694-4cf6-a0b4-48d0f25f0209" facs="#m-d146d012-1784-4d56-aaf0-b2a3d8a88d98" label="lyrics-like">nisi mánserit in vite: sic nec vos,</l><l xml:id="m-53ef70d4-d00e-42eb-90fe-a47c4b0bdc5f" facs="#m-e326945e-0990-48e6-a879-75c425e68c31" label="ambiguous">orrert.</l><l xml:id="m-fa24495f-3f19-4f03-9c9b-85d2da18ab71" facs="#m-a45c1f22-b6f4-450b-8517-51f1e9fe4c74" label="ambiguous">7.</l><l xml:id="m-c228cc45-292e-4f75-9fea-17c6af90d19d" facs="#m-c777f1f9-d692-4048-9490-cfbebf911dfa" label="ambiguous">L</l><l xml:id="m-4d0926b6-7c4f-4535-a349-1349034ad247" facs="#m-f6ba5c29-7ebe-4add-bb7a-4cefcb31876c" label="lyrics-like">Onfi¬ tebúntur" caé¬</l><l xml:id="m-e58d8985-0a6f-4965-89de-53705adfa2bd" facs="#m-22be969a-1218-4a97-9c65-931f60e8c6ae" label="ambiguous">li</l><l xml:id="m-ebd3537f-02da-4a92-9d3b-5de3a3e1a5fd" facs="#m-93c4edc1-7c73-4a67-9dd6-ee564c8e01f5" label="ambiguous">mi-ra-bi¬ li¬</l><l xml:id="m-aed5b389-3515-464a-bdca-6025aadd784c" facs="#m-60229900-75aa-444a-b8d1-a8ea4c2b5e7a" label="lyrics-like">Dó- mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-7ae7b2ed-c26b-47e7-bd18-fa92c875f58b" facs="#m-93e1883e-00c8-4915-83d7-e1ebd5a3ff21" label="lyrics-like">tú¬a</l><l xml:id="m-ae9a164b-f326-4d08-86c6-82764dfd39ba" facs="#m-61812034-d713-4a6d-bb90-1b1428a72987" label="lyrics-like">et ve¬ ri-tá-tem</l><l xml:id="m-39d1e0b1-a6eb-4493-b73e-9e6fd5d9b281" facs="#m-9fcf802a-f78b-414e-b04a-bbac5763b683" label="ambiguous">a</l><l xml:id="m-fe424bf4-54c6-462c-9ae3-72155c8c3ada" facs="#m-6da3ea7a-ff98-4b09-9cf4-2d264dbc4034" label="ambiguous">ne,</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
